but the save files are not compatible with the "kosher" version.

I have offered the patches to the dev team, they weren't interested.
(boo hoo sniff!!!)

Some examples: 

granstel pranin'a       pawthe pran 
feggran krepel          grep pel
wettro mes              blipaal re ampaal
plitredn shakaj         mesmesdes
rewessha                kajstelera anihaq
the pelamash            mesquaa
xin pelkrepkes          amret pilandaquaa


